#: ../../library/cmath.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`cmath` --- mathematical functions for complex numbers"
msgstr ":mod:`cmath` --- fonctions mathématiques pour les nombres complexes"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`cmath` module provides basic mathematical functions for working "
"with complex numbers, including trigonometric, exponential, logarithmic, and"
" conversions between rectangular ``(real, imag)`` and polar ``(r, phi)`` "
"representations."
msgstr ""
"Le module :mod:`cmath` fournit des fonctions mathématiques de base pour "
"travailler avec les nombres complexes, notamment des fonctions "
"trigonométriques, exponentielles, logarithmiques, ainsi que des conversions "
"entre les représentations cartésienne ``(real, imag)`` et polaire ``(r, "
"phi)``."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:13
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fonctions"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:17
msgid "Return the cosine of ``z``."
msgstr "Renvoie le cosinus de ``z``."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:21
msgid "Return the exponential of ``z``."
msgstr "Renvoie l'exponentielle de ``z``."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:25
msgid ""
"Return the natural logarithm of ``z``.  The branch cut is along the negative"
" real axis."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie le logarithme naturel de ``z``. La coupure de branche se situe le "
"long de l'axe réel négatif."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:29
msgid ""
"Return the base-10 logarithm of ``z``.  The branch cut is along the negative"
" real axis."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie le logarithme en base 10 de ``z``. La coupure de branche se situe le"
" long de l'axe réel négatif."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:33
msgid "Returns the phase of the number ``z``, in the range (-pi, +pi]."
msgstr "Renvoie la phase du nombre ``z``, dans l'intervalle (-pi, +pi]."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:37
msgid "Returns, as a tuple, the polar form of ``z``."
msgstr "Renvoie, sous forme de tuple, la forme polaire de ``z``."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:41
msgid "Returns the complex number with modulus ``r`` and phase ``phi``."
msgstr "Renvoie le nombre complexe de module ``r`` et de phase ``phi``."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:45
msgid "Return the sine of ``z``."
msgstr "Renvoie le sinus de ``z``."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:49
msgid "Return the square-root of ``z``."
msgstr "Renvoie la racine carrée de ``z``."

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:52
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Constantes"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:57
msgid "Base of the natural logarithm"
msgstr "Base du logarithme naturel"

#: ../../library/cmath.rst:62
msgid "The ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter"
msgstr "Le rapport entre la circonférence d'un cercle et son diamètre"
